      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Trigger The quoppopak mummy takes fire damage while it is above water\n\n---\n\nEffect The oil coating the mummy ignites. This fire does no additional damage to the mummy but does cause its melee Strikes to inflict an additional 1d6 fire damage. At the end of its turn, the mummy attempts a DC 10 Flat check; on a success, the fire goes out. The fire also goes out immediately if the mummy submerges in water.",
